                    <NoteColor>0xf9ec72ff</NoteColor>
                    <NoteContent>Constraint "weightConstraint" is violated if a luggage item weights more than 18kg. As any other class property, the constraint is inherited in all subclasses. This solution is suboptimal. Ideally, we would like to specify a maximum weight for each luggage class that serves as a maximum range for the constraint. That, however, is not possible in regular class diagrams. We would have to develop a new domain-specific language to address this issue.</NoteContent>
